{"quest_id": 4360, "name": "密林の防衛戦", "description": "魔神の復活を阻止するため、\n封印を守る部族の村を訪れた王子たち。\n襲いくる教団員たちから村を守れ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "風水士と紅の教団", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920049, "map_no": 3606, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 180, "gold": 800, "drops": [{"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"card": 15, "c": 1}, {"item": 2001, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101536, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 316, "global_id": 315, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 15, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097632, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 35, "global_id": 34, "spawn_sec": 4}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 280, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 109, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097696, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 39, "global_id": 38, "spawn_sec": 38}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "そら、これがご希望の魔神の骨片だ。", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "確かに。これは我が主の体の一部。\nさすがは封印の一族の長ミトラ。話が早いな。\nふふふ、また復活に一歩近づいた……。", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ミトラ", "text": "受け取ったならもうこの土地に用はないはずだ。\nさっさと去ってもらおうか。", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "いや、貴様にはまだやってもらうことがある。\n伝説の英雄にゆかりのあるものならば、その命、\n魔神ロノベ様復活のよりしろとして捧げてもらう！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ミトラ", "text": "なんだと！？　あたしらを騙したのか……！！", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！　村が魔神の信徒たちに襲われています！\n一刻も早く助けましょう！", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "なっ、貴様らは……！\nちょうどいい、ここでまとめて片づけてやる！！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "教団員", "text": "ちっ……！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ミトラ", "text": "魔神の骨片をもった奴が森の奥に逃げたぞ！\n追ってくれ！", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！　今すぐ後を追いましょう！", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920049_3606", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 516, "y": 58}, {"k": "b", "x": 335, "y": 284}, {"k": "b", "x": 778, "y": 230}, {"k": "m", "x": 202, "y": 167, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 445, "y": 167, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 382, "y": 425, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 704, "y": 316, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 694, "y": 209, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 675, "y": 119, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 696, "y": 417, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 889, "y": 457, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 781, "y": 467, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 905, "y": 345, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 891, "y": 228, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 820, "y": 121, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 593, "y": 190, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 612, "y": 297, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 609, "y": 416, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 506, "y": 447, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 326, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 508, "y": 236, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 324, "y": 135, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 164, "y": 262, "id": 219}, {"k": "m", "x": 167, "y": 357, "id": 220}, {"k": "m", "x": 268, "y": 405, "id": 221}, {"k": "m", "x": 114, "y": 118, "id": 222}, {"k": "r", "x": 267, "y": 194, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x